d </span><span begin="00:26.060" end="00:26.450">turn </span><span begin="00:26.450" end="00:26.600">the </span><span begin="00:26.600" end="00:27.110">rain </span><span begin="00:27.110" end="00:27.410">to </span><span begin="00:27.410" end="00:27.650">a </span><span begin="00:27.650" end="00:28.970">rainbow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.300" end="00:33.200"><span begin="00:29.300" end="00:29.630">When </span><span begin="00:29.630" end="00:29.750">I </span><span begin="00:29.750" end="00:29.990">was </span><span begin="00:29.990" end="00:30.620">living </span><span begin="00:30.620" end="00:30.800">in </span><span begin="00:30.800" end="00:30.950">the </span><span begin="00:30.950" end="00:33.200">blue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.130" end="00:37.430"><span begin="00:34.130" end="00:34.670">Why </span><span begin="00:34.670" end="00:34.970">then </span><span begin="00:34.970" end="00:35.120">if </span><span begin="00:35.120" end="00:35.570">she </span><span begin="00:35.570" end="00:35.720">is </span><span begin="00:35.720" end="00:36.200">so </span><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:37.430">perfect</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.430" end="00:41.240"><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:37.700">Do </span><span begin="00:37.700" end="00:37.820">I </span><span begin="00:37.820" end="00:38.480">still </span><span begin="00:38.480" end="00:38.990">wish </span><span begin="00:38.990" end="00:39.290">that </span><span begin="00:39.290" end="00:39.410">it </span><span begin="00:39.410" end="00:39.680">was </span><span begin="00:39.680" end="00:41.240">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.620" end="00:45.590"><span begin="00:42.620" end="00:42.917">Perfect </span><span begin="00:42.917" end="00:43.214">don</span><span begin="00:43.214" end="00:43.511">’</span><span begin="00:43.511" end="00:43.808">t </span><span begin="00:43.808" end="00:44.105">mean </span><span begin="00:44.105" end="00:44.402">that </span><span begin="00:44.402" end="0