1" begin="01:19.670" end="01:23.900"><span begin="01:19.670" end="01:20.060">I</span><span begin="01:20.060" end="01:20.090">’</span><span begin="01:20.090" end="01:20.150">m </span><span begin="01:20.150" end="01:20.660">only </span><span begin="01:20.660" end="01:21.110">here </span><span begin="01:21.110" end="01:21.800">passing </span><span begin="01:21.800" end="01:22.250">time </span><span begin="01:22.250" end="01:22.460">in </span><span begin="01:22.460" end="01:22.940">her </span><span begin="01:22.940" end="01:23.900">arms</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.930" end="01:26.150"><span begin="01:23.930" end="01:24.374">Hoping </span><span begin="01:24.374" end="01:24.818">I</span><span begin="01:24.818" end="01:25.262">’</span><span begin="01:25.262" end="01:25.706">ll </span><span begin="01:25.706" end="01:26.150">find</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.870" end="01:32.510"><span begin="01:26.870" end="01:27.140">A </span><span begin="01:27.140" end="01:30.020">glimpse </span><span begin="01:30.020" end="01:30.260">of </span><span begin="01:30.260" end="01:32.510">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.410" end="01:37.100"><span begin="01:33.410" end="01:33.890">Tell </span><span begin="01:33.890" end="01:34.130">me </span><span begin="01:34.130" end="01:34.280">he </span><span begin="01:34.280" end="01:35.270">savors </span><span begin="01:35.270" end="01:35.420">your </span><span begin="01:35.420" end="01:37.100">glory</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.310" end="01:41.300"><span begin="01:37.310" end="01:37.640">Does </span><span begin="01:37.640" end="01:37.760">he </span><span begin="01:37.760" end="01:38.270">laugh </span><span begin="01:38.270" end="01:38.390">the </span><span begin="01:38.390" end="01:38.690">way </span><span begin="01:38.690" end="01:38.840">I </span><span begin="01:38.840" end="01:41.300">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.960" end="01:45.200"><span begin="01:41.960" end="01:42.350">Is </span><span begin="01:42.350" end="01:42.740">this </span><span begin="01:42.740" end="01:42.830">a </span><span begin="01:42.830" end="01:43.490">part </span><span begin="01:43.490" end="01:43.760">of </span><span begin="01:43.760" end="01:43.850">your </span><span begin="01:43.850" end="01:45.200">story</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.410" end="01:49.790"><span begin="01:45.410" end="01:45.860">One </span><span begin="01:45.860" end="01:46.280">that </span><span begin="01:46.280" end="01:46.700">I </span><span begin="01:46.700" end="01:46.910">had </span><span begin="01:46.910" end="01:47.270">never </span><span begin="01:47.270" end="01:49.790">lived</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.390" end="01:53.630"><span begin="01:50.390" end="01:51.140">Maybe </span><span begin="01:51.140" end="01:51.530">one </span><span begin="01:51.530" end="01:51.830">day </span><span begin="01:51.830" end="01:51.950">you</span><span begin="01:51.950" end="01:51.980">’</span><span begin="01:51.980" end="01:52.010">ll </span><span begin="01:52.010" end="01:52.760">feel </span><span begin="01:52.760" end="01:53.630">lonely</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.720" end="01:57.290"><span begin="01:53.720" end="01:53.990">And </span><span begin="01:53.990" end="01:54.170">in </span><span begin="01:54.170" end="01:54.740">his </span><span begin="01:54.740" end="01:55.220">eyes </span><span begin="01:55.220" end="01:55.370">you</span><span begin="01:55.370" end="01:55.400">’</span><span begin="01:55.400" end="01:55.430">ll </span><span begin="01:55.430" end="01:55.610">get </span><span begin="01:55.610" end="01:55.730">a </span><span begin="01:55.730" end="01:57.290">glimpse</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.850" end="02:01.730"><span begin="01:58.850" end="01:59.600">Maybe </span><span begin="01:59.600" end="01:59.810">you</span><span begin="01:59.810" end="01:59.900">’</span><span begin="01:59.900" end="01:59.930">ll </span><span begin="01:59.930" end="02:00.200">start </spa